    <briefdescription>
<para>&quot;Package Graph&quot; builds a single self-contained <ref refid="class_ahah_games_1_1_genesis_noise_1_1_graph_1_1_genesis_noise_package" kindref="compound">GenesisNoisePackage</ref> asset (no AssetBundle) that embeds: </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>a clone of the graph (as a sub-asset, with its owned sub-assets remapped onto the clone),</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the C# source of every node in the graph whose type is not in the <ref refid="namespace_ahah_games_1_1_genesis_noise" kindref="compound">AhahGames.GenesisNoise</ref> namespace (bundled as TextAsset sub-assets),</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the source of the shader assets referenced by those custom nodes (bundled as TextAsset sub-assets),</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the C# source of any property drawers referenced by any shader in the graph that are not in the <ref refid="namespace_ahah_games_1_1_genesis_noise" kindref="compound">AhahGames.GenesisNoise</ref> namespace (ShaderLab [Foo] attributes resolve to a FooDrawer MaterialPropertyDrawer subclass; those are bundled as TextAsset sub-assets). The package asset is named after the graph and carries the <ref refid="class_ahah_games_1_1_genesis_noise_1_1_graph_1_1_genesis_noise_package" kindref="compound">GenesisNoisePackage</ref> icon. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
